# Vulnerabilities intentionally accepted after review.
# Each entry MUST have a comment explaining why - never ignore silently.
#
# Most findings from node-tar and similar bundled-in-npm packages are
# now handled by `ignore-unfixed: true` in the CI workflow (they have
# no available fix yet, since they live inside the Node.js base image's
# internal tooling, not our own dependencies). This file is for cases
# where a fix DOES exist upstream but we've deliberately chosen not to
# take it yet, with a documented reason below.
